{"4421700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UwUzon", "steam_appid": 4421700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UwUzon</strong> is an arcade-style obstacle-dodger set in a satirical mega-warehouse where the only goal is to <strong>make it out</strong>, and maybe uncover the<strong> secrets of management.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re essentially playing <strong>Frogger in a fulfillment center</strong>: sprint across dangerous lanes, juke around moving hazards, and thread impossible gaps between semitrucks, falling boxes, and warehouse mayhem. The layout shifts every run, so you’re always one mistake away from getting flattened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trying to reach the exit.<br>You won’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade “Frogger-like” dodging</strong>: short runs, instant restarts, pure reflex + timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized chunk layouts</strong> that keep routes changing and runs unpredictable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warehouse hazards everywhere</strong>: semitrucks, falling boxes, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple to start, hard to survive</strong>: learn patterns, react faster, push deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate satire vibe</strong> where every near-death experience somehow increases Shareholder Value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like tight, replayable arcade games where progress is earned in seconds and lost in an instant, UwUzon is your kind of shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never forget the most important thing: our shareholders.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p c